        "subject": "LU-11728 tests: skip connectathon in parallel-scale-nfsv3",
        "message": "LU-11728 tests: skip connectathon in parallel-scale-nfsv3\n\nInterop sessions run the test scripts of the older branch,\nwhich still runs connectathon under NFSv3. Its locking\ntests fail with ENOLCK (LU-18649), so every such session\nfails parallel-scale-nfsv3 test_connectathon.\n\nSkip the test on this branch, as LU-18649 did on master.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=parallel-scale-nfsv3\nLustre-change: https://review.whamcloud.com/61349\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Id7ea5de3f569ec484f8ae4686dbb425c08382cdd\n"
      },
